   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\">\n    <li>What two equations are represented by the graph? Select<strong> two</strong>.<br> <img src=\"exercises/media/b8ef39867fb7edd0.jpg\" width=\"300\" alt=\"A graph showing two intersecting lines, one red and one blue, on a white grid with black axes. The lines intersect at the point (1, 1).\"></li>\n  </ol>\n  <ol type=\"a\">\n    <li><span data-math=\"y=x-1\">y=x-1</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"y=x+1\">y=x+1</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"y=\\frac13x+2\">y=\\frac13x+2</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"y=3x-2\">y=3x-2</span></li>\n  </ol>",
